  "content": {
    "id": "p40-q62-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "62",
    "prompt": "Solve the equation for $0\\leq\\theta\\leq2\\pi$:\n$$\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=1.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2},\\dfrac{11\\pi}{6}$.\n\nExpand and combine the left-hand side as $2\\cos(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6})$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)&=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos\\theta+\\frac12\\sin\\theta+\\frac12\\sin\\theta+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos\\theta\\\\\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)&=\\sqrt3\\cos\\theta+\\sin\\theta\\\\\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)&=2\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right).\\end{align*}$$\nThe equation becomes\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)&=1\\\\\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)&=\\frac12.\\end{align*}$$\nSince $-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\leq\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\leq\\frac{11\\pi}{6}$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{6}&=\\frac{\\pi}{3},\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\\\\\\theta&=\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{11\\pi}{6}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
